job_description:
Social Media Strategist (Exp: 5-10 years)
Key Responsibilities:
1. Optimize campaigns and funnels to maximize efficiency and performance of key metrics;
2. Creating and promoting company blog/post on a weekly basis;
3. Coordinate with teams to develop social media timelines coinciding with new product releases, ad campaigns, or other brand messages;
4. Producing a consistent brand message across all the social media channels;
5. Handle Social Media pages on all platforms (Facebook, Instagram & Twitter, etc.) and the blog;
6. Create & manage all Social Media campaigns;
7. Producing content for social media including images & videos etc;
8. Daily social media management (Facebook, Twitter, Instagram);
9. Oversee all aspects of Social Media communication, engagement, and marketing.
Qualifications/Requirement:
1. Desired Candidate Profile: MBA in Marketing, BTech/B.E(C.S.E/ IT/ E.C.E), MCA
2. Excellent writing and language skills;
3. Proficiency in MS Excel, Word, and PowerPoint.
4. In-depth knowledge of social media platforms such as Facebook, Twitter, Linkedin;
5. Knowledge of web analytics tools;
6. Excellent knowledge of research requirements for social media strategy.
7. Outstanding proofreading and editing skills.
8. Sound knowledge of paid social media advertising.
If this opportunity aligns with your career goals, kindly share your updated resume with us at jobs@webandcrafts.com
